    "Id": "chassisdef_extinguisher_EFM-1",
    "Name": "Extinguisher",
    "Details": "The Extinguisher FireMech mounts two sprayers connected to ten ton liquid storage tanks, backed by a flamer for controlled burns and a chainsaw for clearing debris. A small laser in the right arm handles precision work near survivors, while a searchlight and paramedic supplies support rescue operations.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Easy to Pilot</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 0.87</color></b>",
