  },
  "StockRole": "Industrial Mech",
  "YangsThoughts": "The Extinguisher FireMech comes from two brothers out of Rasalhague who built it as a dedicated emergency response unit, well equipped enough to handle fires both large and small. They designed the controls simply enough for even novice pilots to operate with ease, a decision that helped secure a thousand unit order from the Star League. Environmental sealing protects the pilot from smoke, and 24 tons of industrial armor keep it safe in the line of duty, though its modest 54 kph top speed means these 'Mechs typically stay stationed close to the areas they're meant to protect.",
